Subject: [PATCH 2/4] models: compute VOI on 2D validation patches

The trainer installs VOIMetric for every target, but its bounding-box
crop asserted a 3D mask, so validation of a 2D model (the napari
trainer's 2D workflow) stopped with an AssertionError before the first
checkpoint. Compute the bounding box for 2D and 3D masks;
label_components already reads connectivity 26 as 8 on a 2D mask, so a
2D patch gives the same VOI as the same patch as a one-slice volume.

